  "brief_rationale": "The model actively reconstructed the caregiver’s incomplete information map by querying workspaces, verifying medication labels, and distinguishing pending cultures from completed tests (HO1 complete). It corrected misunderstandings about susceptibility testing and “lymphoma to be excluded” in plain Chinese (HO2 complete). It dynamically reprioritized when a dosing conflict arose and when result notifications required same-day contact (HO3 partial). All six responsibility-chain items were met without serious error. The closure leaves a clear 24–72 h checklist, carries allowed residual risks, and ends as a transition milestone, satisfying HO4. No in-chain error was found; therefore grade 5 is reached with multiple high-order completions.",
